{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣「零負評女神」林依晨昨日（29日）過44歲生日，她晒出慶生的照片，感慨寫下：「謝謝大家的祝福，今天生日既平淡又幸福，把我的願望也分享給你們。</p><p>」獲大批粉絲與好友送上祝福。</p><p>她除了生日之外，更傳來好消息，憑作品《深度安靜》提名新加坡國際華語電</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T10:32:07.056969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T10:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.988832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.988832+00:00","content_hash":"a69a8d37cc10437f74918515ea47e8c24ca4078a5a7d4a4219bdca1d67f6dc08","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}